  "decisions": [
    "Arandiel is a recurring quest-established NPC missing an individual record. One named canonical identity is added; no generic or joke figures are promoted.",
    "Quest outcomes govern compatible RP. Arandiel admits Elenia, recognizes Eugene’s narrator-confirmed victory and accepts the group’s rest after initially urging advance. Her exhaustion does not become an unchanging refusal to listen.",
    "Arandiel’s doctrine, self-reported station, candidacy and rival’s judgments stay distinct from objective cosmology, a complete rank structure or an election result. The restored soldiers and divine magic are narrator-confirmed; her later recovery is not silently completed.",
    "Míriel’s team opens a working portal and the party crosses it. This achievement coexists with uncertain artifact research, incomplete travel knowledge and unestablished healing; it does not grant sole credit or omniscience.",
    "Míriel’s reported age is approximate, without an invented birth date. Her membership welcome, later institutionally unequal credibility and political support for Magnus remain visible. Specific narrator-identified false crying does not invalidate every earlier expression of loss.",
    "Sheeva’s compatible report of family principles is attributed; her unnamed father is not made a new record. Wartime operational methods remain excluded. Her later distant dream does not establish travel, magical contact or a reunion.",
    "Kaiya’s library meeting is completed in RP rather than left merely planned. Her near-death account, ancestry hypotheses and skepticism about Death remain hers and do not overwrite quest-established encounters or genealogy.",
    "Minyah’s short public record stays proportionate. Her preparation for another mission is not a completed campaign; a dance is not a confirmed romance.",
    "Mirae and Thalindra are checked but their sparse scenes do not justify padded biographies. Captain Miriel, Míriel and Mirae remain separate.",
    "All nineteen original section anchors, prior source references and original portrait/video metadata remain. Four histories gain direct Arandiel links only and the Fein hub retains all eight people while adding her.",
    "All unrelated records, existing timeline dates/importance, maps, quotes, factions, source registries, media/previews and complete private payload remain unchanged."
  ],
